    {
      "id": "p9-childhood-household.supper-bowl",
      "title": "一锅土豆汤",
      "weight": 1,
      "rate": 0.036,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "age",
          "min": 3,
          "max": 8
        },
        {
          "kind": "householdSize",
          "min": 4
        },
        {
          "kind": "cash",
          "max": 45
        }
      ],
      "roles": [
        {
          "key": "subject",
          "kind": "subject",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 3,
          "maxAge": 8
        },
        {
          "key": "parent",
          "kind": "parent",
          "required": true,
          "minAge": 22,
          "maxAge": 50
        },
        {
          "key": "sibling",
          "kind": "sibling",
          "required": false,
          "minAge": 2,
          "maxAge": 14
        }
      ],
      "outcomes": [
        {
          "id": "gave-potato-to-younger",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}把碗里那块最大的土豆拨到{sibling}碗里，自己用汤水泡着面包吃。{parent}看见了，没说话，把盘里那片薄香肠掰下一半，压在{subject}的碗底，又用勺子在锅底刮了两下。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "food",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": 1,
              "reason": "分食让全家这顿勉强吃饱"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$sibling",
              "kind": "kin",
              "trust": 0.08,
              "affection": 0.1,
              "obligation": 0.04,
              "fear": 0,
              "respect": 0,
              "reason": "让出土豆给更小的弟妹"
            },
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": 0.03,
              "reason": "被母亲暗中照顾"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "p9-childhood-household.supper-bowl.gave-potato-to-younger.alt1",
              "key": "gave-potato-to-younger",
              "text": "锅里的汤只剩一层，{subject}用勺子在锅底捞了捞，把最大的一块土豆舀进{sibling}碗里。{sibling}低头就吃，{parent}把自己的香肠片撕开，一半放进{subject}碗底，一半留在盘边。{subject}吃到碗底才发现，耳朵有点热。",
              "tone": ["dry"]
            },
            {
              "id": "p9-childhood-household.supper-bowl.gave-potato-to-younger.alt2",
              "key": "gave-potato-to-younger",
              "text": "{sibling}的碗先见了底，{subject}把自己那块土豆拨过去，说“我不爱吃面的”。{parent}没拆穿，转身去灶口添煤，回来时把半片香肠压在{subject}的面包下面。锅底刮得响，{subject}把香肠又分了一半给{sibling}。",
              "tone": ["matter-of-fact"]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "caught-adding-ladle",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}趁{parent}转身去灶口添煤，又把勺子伸进锅里刮下半个土豆。{parent}从桌边抬起眼，什么也没说，只把碗往桌中央推了推；{subject}立刻把勺子放下，坐得笔直，手心发烫。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "mood",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.04,
              "reason": "被父亲看见后感到羞愧"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$parent",
              "kind": "kin",
              "trust": 0.03,
              "affection": -0.02,
              "obligation": 0.05,
              "fear": 0.06,
              "respect": 0.04,
              "reason": "父亲沉默的管教"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "p9-childhood-household.supper-bowl.caught-adding-ladle.alt1",
              "key": "caught-adding-ladle",
              "text": "锅盖还冒着气，{subject}听见{parent}去灶口添煤，勺子立刻伸进锅里，刮起粘在锅边的半个土豆。{parent}回来时没坐下，只站在桌边看。{subject}把勺子放回碗里，膝盖并紧，手心在桌沿上蹭出一层汗。",
              "tone": ["dry"]
            },
            {
              "id": "p9-childhood-household.supper-bowl.caught-adding-ladle.alt2",
              "key": "caught-adding-ladle",
              "text": "{subject}的勺子刚碰到锅底，{parent}就转过身来。两个人都没说话。{parent}把自己的碗往桌子中间推了推，又拿起面包继续撕。{subject}盯着碗里剩下的汤，一口一口喝完，没敢再抬头。",
              "tone": ["matter-of-fact"]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "saved-bread-for-morning",
          "weight": 1,
          "text": "{subject}说自己在外面已经吃过，把分到的黑面包留在桌上，用布盖好。夜里肚子叫得睡不着，翻来覆去听着{sibling}的呼吸声；天亮时那块面包还在，边缘硬得能敲响桌面，{parent}把它掰成三份。",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "food",
              "householdId": "$household",
              "amount": 1,
              "reason": "省下的面包留到次日早餐"
            },
            {
              "type": "health",
              "personId": "$subject",
              "amount": -0.03,
              "reason": "夜里空腹未进食"
            },
            {
              "type": "relation",
              "a": "$subject",
              "b": "$parent",
              "kind": "kin",
              "trust": 0.05,
              "affection": 0.06,
              "obligation": 0.03,
              "fear": 0,
              "respect": 0.02,
              "reason": "母亲看出孩子懂事"
            }
          ],
          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "p9-childhood-household.supper-bowl.saved-bread-for-morning.alt1",
              "key": "saved-bread-for-morning",
              "text": "面包分到{subject}手里时，{subject}说在巷口吃过了，把它搁在桌角，用一块干净布盖上。夜里{subject}翻来覆去，胃里像有只手在拧，{sibling}的呼吸倒很匀。天亮后{parent}掀开布，面包边已经硬得发白，{parent}拿刀切成三份。",
              "tone": ["dry"]
            },
            {
              "id": "p9-childhood-household.supper-bowl.saved-bread-for-morning.alt2",
              "key": "saved-bread-for-morning",
              "text": "{subject}把面包藏进碗柜最上层，说自己不饿。夜里饿醒了两回，{subject}去灶台边喝凉水，回来时看见{parent}站在碗柜前。{parent}没问，只把面包拿出来，掰成三份，最大的一份放在{subject}的碗里。",
              "tone": ["matter-of-fact"]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p9-childhood-household.water-and-coal",
      "title": "上学前的两桶水",
      "weight": 1,
      "rate": 0.036,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "age",
          "min": 6,
          "max": 11
        },
        {
          "kind": "householdSize",
          "min": 4
        },
        {
